msgid "安全与敏感数据"
msgstr "Security and sensitive data"

msgid ""
"问题报告应给出版本、范围、权限前提、触发路径和已验证层次，不附密码、令牌、 Cookie、私钥或未脱敏邮件。静态观察与真实运行证据分开，不虚构修复版本。 "
"临时审计和完整日志写入输出目录，现行手册只保留经确认的接口约束和操作步骤。"
msgstr ""
"Issue reports should include version, scope, required privileges, trigger path, and verified "
"layers, without passwords, tokens, cookies, private keys, or unredacted mail. Separate static "
"observations from runtime evidence; do not invent fixed versions. Write temporary audits and full "
"logs to the output directory. The current manual retains only confirmed interface constraints and "
"operating steps."

msgid ""
"TLS 失败区分 DNS、TCP、握手、证书链、主机名、时钟和传输阶段；不得关闭验证。 特权工具遵守文件身份、目录权限和最小环境要求，不能把预览当已完成事务。 账户资料及管理员授权见 "
":doc:`../admin-guide/accounts`。"
msgstr ""
"Distinguish DNS, TCP, handshake, certificate-chain, hostname, clock, and transport stages for TLS "
"failures; never disable verification. Privileged tools must respect file identity, directory "
"permissions, and minimal-environment requirements. A preview is not a completed transaction. For "
"account data and administrator authorization, see :doc:`../admin-guide/accounts`."
